Story: Watching a flight from the pilot box
  As a pilot with a real plane
  I want to see the flight in the 3D view of the simulator
  So that I can replay what the plane did, and record pictures for a camera system

  Start the view before the plane is on. The view stays empty until the telemetry starts.
  After that, the plane appears where it is, and it moves and banks with the real plane. The
  link drops for a while, and the plane stays where it was last heard.

  Scenario: The plane takes off, turns and goes quiet
    When 1 second passes
    Then the plane in the view is missing
    When the telemetry is flowing
    And the reported height is 40 m
    And the reported distance north of home is 120 m
    And 1 second passes
    Then the plane in the view is shown
    And the height above the pilot box in the view is 40 m
    And the distance north of the pilot box in the view is 120 m
    When the reported bank is 30 degrees
    And the reported heading is east
    And 1 second passes
    Then the right wing in the view is low
    And the heading in the view is east
    When the telemetry is silent
    And 10 seconds pass
    Then the plane in the view is shown
